  text: '*The creature stands before you as it does everyday, but you notice something
    odd about it* Thank you. You saved him. *A woman''s voice can be heard from its
    lips. They moved, they actually moved. For a moment you think you''re going insane.
    It can speak normally? What madness is this? Was this actually a person? You
    had heard the rumours but for them to actually be true?* ASSIGN ME. ASSIGN ME
    ASSIGN ME. '
